{"version":1,"content":"<p>法國多地上周六（17日）爆發的大規模示威演變成騷亂。</p><p>騷亂過後，多個城市建築物受損、部分名勝被塗鴉，街頭滿目瘡痍。</p><p>截至當地時間18日，近2400人被捕，近1000名警察和憲兵受傷。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T04:39:24.721015+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T04:06:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T17:17:44.177947+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T04:38:13.788068+00:00","content_hash":"cb2b187bb1be951b3788707d75a0e81e4ef91ab1e84cb2e745bbcf3a688e35c1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}